{"step_index":522,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:51:32Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. \"C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\오늘\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑.csv\"\n\n빠진사업자번호 회사만 정확한 인터넷에서 내사실제볼수있는 데이터만 빈칸에만 입력하고 입력한거는 빨간색 글자칠해라 \n2. 구현계쇡부터짜바\n3. 모든가용가능한사이트에서 찾아라\n4. 다하고 하번더 사업자번호만 딥하게 구글구ㅡ라운드서칭까지 다 동해해서 있는지 바라 추론해랄고\n5. 사업자번호가있는회사 모든열 빈칸있으면 채워라\n6. 기존에 우째 입력한지 파악하고 그 형식을따랄라\n7. 아마지막으로 모든데이터는 출처를 적는다\n8. 다하고 한번도 검증해라 나는 분명히 모든 가용가능하인터넷에서 내가볼수있는선에서 라고했다\n9. 야 기존행번호는가르켜줘야지\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: Target file `C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\오늘\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑.csv`\n  1. Find missing business registration numbers (`사업자번호`) only using 100% verified, real data actually viewable on the internet (Zero hallucination policy).\n  2. Populate blank cells only, leaving existing numbers intact.\n  3. Format all newly entered values in **RED font** (`#FF0000`) in Excel.\n  4. Perform a deep secondary pass with web/grounded search and reasoning to uncover any elusive business numbers.\n  5. For companies with a business number, fill all empty columns if verifiable data exists.\n  6. Follow existing format conventions strictly.\n  7. Record the exact source URL for every piece of data in the newly added `데이터 출처` column.\n  8. Provide the exact original row numbers (`기존 행번호`) for all newly filled entries so the user can easily locate and review them.\n- **Constraints**:\n  - NO access to `C:\\Users\\lg\\OneDrive`.\n  - Zero hallucination: Never guess or fabricate unverified numbers; unverified companies must remain blank.\n  - User name: 배현명.\n\n